{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/git' data-target='computer\/program\/git' data-title='Git'>\r\n\t\t\tGit\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Stash: git stash, (save), apply, pop, drop, and list.","label":"Stash","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/git\/signed","label":"Signed","url":"\/computer\/program\/git\/signed"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/git\/submodule","label":"Submodule","url":"\/computer\/program\/git\/submodule"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>git stash<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tStashes current changes.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>git  stash --all<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tStashes ALL changes - even the untracked ones! CAREFULL.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>(save)<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tSaves the current changes and brings the repo state to default.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>-u<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t?untracked?\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>apply<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tApplies the saved stash.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDOES NOT REMOVE from the stash, use pop.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>pop<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tApply and remove from stash (if successful).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>stash@{&lt;N&gt;}<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t?Particular?\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>drop<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDeletes topmost stash.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tClear.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>show -p stash@{&lt;N&gt;}<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tN:0\u2026.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPowershell: \u2018{\u2018 or `{.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>list<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tShow list.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>show<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tShow files in latest stash.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>-p<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tShow contents as well.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>stash@{&lt;N&gt;}<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tShow of particular stash.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/git\/stash\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/git\/stash\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/git\/signed' data-target='computer\/program\/git\/signed' data-title='Signed' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Signed<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/git\/submodule' data-target='computer\/program\/git\/submodule' data-title='Submodule' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block